# mesa, built from the upstream release tarball with a checked-in PKGBUILD (`pkgbuild_local`
# below), not fetched from the holo monorepo, which ships an older all-driver mesa. The PKGBUILD
# builds only freedreno: the gallium GL driver and Turnip (Vulkan), with LLVM, rust and every
# other driver off. pkgver and the tarball's sha256 live in the PKGBUILD; build-overlay.sh
# pre-seeds the tarball with ./fetch-source.sh (upstream first, then the mirror in ./mirror.pin,
# both checked against that sha256).
#
# packages/mesa-x86 (the FEX guest driver) builds the same tarball with the same `patches:`, in
# the same order.
#
# The patches, by area (patches/README.md describes each one and when it can go):
#   0003-0013     pre-rotated presents: rotated preTransform and optional pre-rotated presents
#                 in the Wayland WSI and EGL, rotated blits in gallium/freedreno.
#   0014          the A610's own register table, from the stock Android driver.
#   0017-0019     Turnip autotune: GMEM vs sysmem from per-GPU costs.
#   0020          Arch's revert of a 26.3.1 EGL regression (mesa#16934).
#   0021-0022     freedreno A8xx (SM8750) GL hang fixes from armada PR #894.
#   0023-0028     freedreno A722 (SM7750, Retroid Pocket Duo) fixes from armada.
# The gaps are patches 26.3 took (0001, 0002, 0015, 0016); the numbers are kept so the ones still
# here keep the names the docs and history use.
#
# Upstream source (informational; build-overlay.sh and fetch-source.sh use the PKGBUILD's):
#   url:    https://archive.mesa3d.org/mesa-26.3.1.tar.xz
#   sha256: 4e4e438eac7b840a9383988cbb7c08dad8041da544b9319fc26d319fa7348961
#
# To bump mesa:
#   1. Download the tarball and its .sig, verify the signature and check the signer against the
#      fingerprint in the PKGBUILD's provenance note (mesa publishes no .sha256sum).
#   2. Set pkgver and sha256sums in the PKGBUILD, and the url/sha256 lines above.
#   3. Set sha512 in ./mirror.pin from Fedora's lookaside (empty if Fedora has not packaged it).
#   4. Apply the patches to the new tree cumulatively, in this order, and re-roll the ones that
#      fail; drop the ones the release carries.
#   5. `make relock`: the mesa rows in rootfs/manifest.lock carry a hash of this file, its patches
#      and the PKGBUILD (packages/inputhash.sh), and so do the other packages mesa emits.
#
# Fields (see packages/README.md):
#   name           pkgbase (must match the PKGBUILD); also the work/ build dir name
#   pkgbuild_local path, relative to this dir, of the checked-in PKGBUILD
#   pkgrel_suffix  appended to the PKGBUILD's pkgrel (N -> N.<suffix>) so pacman prefers our build
#                  over holo's; an integer (makepkg wants pkgrel = integer[.integer])
#   patches        files under patches/, applied in this order with `patch -p1` in the mesa source
#                  root (after the first `cd` in prepare())
name: mesa
pkgbuild_local: PKGBUILD
pkgrel_suffix: 1
patches: 0003-wsi-wayland-sort-surface-formats-by-preference.patch 0004-wsi-add-vkCmdBlitImage2-to-the-dispatch-table.patch 0005-wsi-wayland-support-rotated-preTransform.patch 0006-wsi-wayland-add-optional-pre-rotated-presents.patch 0007-wsi-wayland-keep-the-modifier-on-feedback-changes-wh.patch 0008-gallium-add-rotation-to-pipe_blit_info.patch 0009-util-blitter-support-rotated-blits.patch 0010-freedreno-support-rotated-blits.patch 0011-dri-pass-rotation-through-dri2_blit_image.patch 0012-egl-wayland-add-optional-pre-rotated-presents.patch 0013-wsi-wayland-resend-a-rotated-buffer-transform-with-e.patch 0014-freedreno-a610-registers-from-the-stock-blob.patch 0017-tu-autotune-Estimate-GMEM-and-sysmem-time-from-per-G.patch 0018-tu-autotune-Correct-the-estimates-with-measured-rend.patch 0019-tu-autotune-Add-a-probe-that-measures-the-costs-on-t.patch 0020-Revert-mesa-don-t-advertise-APIs-that-are-not-built.patch 0021-freedreno-a8xx-wait-for-zpass-sample-counts.patch 0022-freedreno-a8xx-rb-done-ts-after-each-draw.patch 0023-freedreno-a722-blob-regs.patch 0024-freedreno-a722-skip-bv-bin-preamble.patch 0025-freedreno-a722-no-lpac.patch 0026-freedreno-a722-disable-uav-ubwc.patch 0027-freedreno-a722-tile-align-32.patch 0028-freedreno-a7xx-gen1-no-early-preamble.patch
